WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.547
Explain ways to keep water bodies clean

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:09.064
Resource: something useful that people can use to meet needs. Conservation: using

00:00:09.064 --> 00:00:11.091
resources carefully so they last.

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:17.549
Water pollution: contamination that makes water unsafe. Reuse: using an item again

00:00:17.549 --> 00:00:22.214
instead of wasting it. Sustainability: meeting today’s needs while protecting

00:00:22.214 --> 00:00:22.681
tomorrow’s.

00:00:23.533 --> 00:00:27.971
Measure how much water your class might save by stopping one daily wasteful habit.
